- Quarterly revenue and month-to-month trend (QoQ growth %)
- Gross margin and operating margin
- Customer concentration (top 5 customers % of revenue)
- Receivables / DSO and cash collection rate
- ARR / revenue run-rate and churn (if subscription business)
- Capex, debt obligations, and committed hires

