- Liquidity/runway mis-estimate
  - Risk: Inconsistent or optimistic burn assumptions could leave us short.
  - Mitigation: Reconcile cash + monthly P&L immediately; run weekly cash forecasts and 0/3/6/12 month scenarios; establish a >9-month minimum contingency runway target for board approval.
