- “We finished the quarter with $1.5M in cash and $1.8M revenue for the quarter. At our current operating posture we have meaningful runway (XX months — see note on calculation) that allows us to pursue prioritized product and sales investments. The finance team is focused on three priorities: (1) reconciling monthly burn drivers and delivering a 12‑month rolling cash forecast, (2) improving revenue predictability through bookings/renewal discipline, and (3) reducing customer concentration and payment timing risk. We recommend presenting a 3‑scenario forecast (base / downside / upside) and asking the Board to approve a threshold for fundraising or cost actions if cash falls below an agreed trigger (e.g., 12–15 months).”

