- Downside: higher spend or slower revenue (burn $100K/month) → runway ≈ 15 months — triggers fundraising or cuts.

What I need from you to finalize the materials
- Confirm whether the $45K burn is net of revenue and whether the 20-month runway already includes planned spend increases. If not, provide planned monthly spend (or hires/marketing dollars) or confirm true net burn.
