Near-term priorities are to convert the top-of-funnel pipeline into bookings, complete the Q2 product launch that enables premium pricing, and selectively invest in growth where ROI is clear. We recommend maintaining optionality on capital — no immediate fundraise is required at current burn, but we should prepare market materials and defensible scenarios should we accelerate hire or pursue inorganic opportunities."

