   - Risk: Misstated runway could give a false sense of security or urgency.
   - Mitigation: Standardize burn definition (cash burn post-revenue receipts? operating cash flow?), publish a 13/24-week cash forecast, reconcile GAAP P&L vs cash flow each board pack.

