6. Churn & retention risk
   - Risk: Higher churn than expected undermines recurring revenue growth.
   - Mitigation: Strengthen customer success, add contractual retention incentives, track cohort retention metrics.

7. Macro / customer budget risk
   - Risk: Customers cut budgets or slow purchasing cycles, impacting bookings.
   - Mitigation: Expand into counter-cyclical verticals, offer flexible pricing, accelerate shorter-term contracts.

8. One-time liabilities or legal / compliance exposures
   - Risk: Unexpected legal, tax, or compliance costs could reduce cash runway.
   - Mitigation: Quarterly legal and tax review, reserve for contingencies.

