  - Why: Inconsistent definitions (burn, runway, revenue) undermines board trust.
  - Impact: Poor decision-making; reputational risk.
  - Mitigation: Standardize definitions (cash burn = net cash outflow excluding financing; runway = cash / projected net cash outflows), present reconciliations in pack.
